    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792660/extras/73a68258bb62e06f3e954f35bd48efca.avif?t=1714245056\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><br>Katana's Path is a fast-paced arena slasher, where you can control your samurai and your katana in a unique game mechanic. Slash through many enemies and craft an array of overpowering builds, fighting at a rainy cyberpunk city or colorful forests using the best gear you can get!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense and frantic combat<br></li><li>Attack freely, move your katana in any direction<br></li><li>Select beetwen 12 perks and make the most powefull build<br></li><li>Handle many katanas at the same time and summon thunders on your enemies, build your own abilites<br></li><li>Kill the enemies with your katana and your throwing secondary weapon<br></li><li>Dynamic combo system<br></li><li>Various enemies to kill<br></li><li>Many equipments do unlock<br></li><li>Different levels to play<br></li><li>Endless hordes of enemies to play as much as you want</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Arenas to Play!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792660/extras/7dccf51703e4a1db6290b53166fccc26.avif?t=1714245056\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792660/extras/3892e15d3d481e02c276b74f728c636f.avif?t=1714245056\" width=616 height=140 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792660/extras/6a8f460dd175c0e8932160e8cbd65109.avif?t=1714245056\" width=616 height=140 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Katanas Path now!</h2>",
